   pass  bundle fast  app.js (gzip)                  3.2 kB  budget 30.0 kB
         minified 7.5 kB; largest inputs: web-vitals/dist/web-vitals.js 5.6 kB, src/client/fast.ts 0.9 kB, src/client/data.ts 0.7 kB, src/client/vitals.ts 0.4 kB
   ok: the slow bundle is over budget, the fast one within it
   ok: the metafile blames moment's locales and lodash for the slow bundle

## 3. Lab: Lighthouse on both pages
   concept: Lighthouse 13 headless on the Chromium in PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH (chrome-launcher, --no-sandbox): mobile, simulated slow 4G and 4x CPU. It reports LCP, CLS and TBT (the lab stand-in for INP: there is no user to interact) and every byte loaded
   slow: score 47, LCP 30768 ms (body > main > img.hero), FCP 3918 ms, CLS 0.137, TBT 456 ms, 7 requests, scripts 467.3 kB, images 5511.0 kB, total 5980.7 kB
         render-blocking: /slow/tag.js, /slow/app.js, /slow/styles.css; report out/lighthouse-slow.html
   fast: score 99, LCP 1295 ms (body > main > picture > img.hero), FCP 815 ms, CLS 0, TBT 115 ms, 6 requests, scripts 3.7 kB, images 2.4 kB, total 8.0 kB
         render-blocking: none; report out/lighthouse-fast.html
