## 4. Field: Core Web Vitals from visits, p75
   concept: each page runs the web-vitals library and sends every metric with navigator.sendBeacon to the collector on :53149, which appends it to out/vitals.ndjson. Simulated members visit under three network and CPU profiles, read, tap "Show full history" (that tap is what INP measures) and leave
   profile desktop  no throttling
   profile 4g       9.0 Mbit/s down, 60 ms latency, CPU 2x slower
   profile slow-4g  4.0 Mbit/s down, 120 ms latency, CPU 4x slower
   slow x desktop  4 visits, 3.7s 3.7s 3.6s 3.9s
   slow x 4g       4 visits, 8.7s 8.5s 8.4s 8.4s
   slow x slow-4g  4 visits, 15.3s 15.8s 15.1s 15.6s
   fast x desktop  4 visits, 3.3s 3.3s 3.3s 3.3s
   fast x 4g       4 visits, 3.5s 3.4s 3.4s 3.5s
   fast x slow-4g  4 visits, 4.0s 4.4s 3.9s 3.8s
   collector stored 120 metrics from 24 visits; a malformed beacon got HTTP 400
   ok: every visit reported LCP, CLS and INP (and FCP, TTFB)
   ok: the collector validates what it stores: a beacon with a non-numeric value is refused with 400
